<tr><td>CO₂ measured / reduced</td><td>~35,000 / ~2,500 tCO₂e per year</td><td>CEA factor 0.7117 tCO₂/MWh; BEE SME audit savings rates</td></tr>
<tr><td>Energy saved</td><td>~3.5 GWh/yr (5–15% per unit)</td><td>BEE SME cluster audit findings</td></tr>
