</table>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 9 -->
<div class="slide">
<h2>18-month roadmap &amp; budget (₹12 lakh pilot)</h2>
<br>
<table>
<tr><th>Phase</th><th>Months</th><th>Milestones</th></tr>
<tr><td><b>Done</b></td><td>—</td><td>Functional prototype: AI pipeline, factor engine, dashboard, reports</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>1. Field-ready</b></td><td>1–3</td><td>Cluster association LOIs (Morbi, Tiruppur) · top-3 language UI · methodology note published</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>2. Pilot</b></td><td>4–9</td><td>90-day pilot with 15–20 units → scale to 200 · field accuracy tuning · first paid tiers</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>3. Prove &amp; integrate</b></td><td>10–14</td><td>Verified savings case studies · ACVA/verifier integration path · incubator + RAMP linkage</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>4. Scale</b></td><td>15–18</td><td>2 more clusters · association licensing model · 10+ languages</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Budget: cloud &amp; AI ₹2.5L · localization ₹1.5L · field onboarding &amp; training ₹4L · travel ₹1.5L · methodology/verification advisory ₹1.5L · contingency ₹1L</p>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 10 -->
<div class="slide">
<h2>Why this wins, and the ask</h2>
<br>
<p class="big">Regulation has made carbon measurement mandatory. CarbonSathi makes it possible for the 8.7 crore businesses that were left out.</p>
<ul>
<li><b>Timely:</b> rides two live deadlines (CCTS 31 July 2026, CBAM paid phase)</li>
<li><b>Real:</b> prototype runs end to end today, built by someone who has shipped production AI platforms</li>
<li><b>Aligned:</b> NDC 45% intensity cut · Net Zero 2070 · Mission LiFE · Viksit Bharat 2047 · SDGs 7/8/9/12/13</li>
<li><b>Scalable:</b> software + cluster-association distribution; CCTS pull toward 740+ obligated entities</li>
</ul>
<div class="box"><b>The ask:</b> jury validation and mentorship to convert the pilot pipeline into signed cluster LOIs — and take India's carbon market to the base of its economy.</div>
<br>
<p align="center"><b>India cannot manage what six crore of its businesses cannot measure. CarbonSathi makes them count.</b></p>
</div>

